This page aims to aid in progression when using {{ClassTooltip|Chronomancer}} in [[Quasi-Realms#In Over Your Head|In Over Your Head Quasi-Realm]] by providing information, procedures, builds, or detailed recommendations.

==Introduction==
This [[Quasi-Realms|Quasi-Realm]] is played with {{ClassTooltip|Chronomancer}}.
* Starts with {{PetTooltip|Temporal Paradox}}, a Pet unique to this Quasi-Realm
** Generates [[Compressed Time]].
** Periodically generates Mana.
* {{SpellTooltip|Time Fork}} replaces {{SpellTooltip|Time Helix}}
** Every cast of this spell while {{SpellTooltip|Generate Paradox}} is active increases the pet level of {{PetTooltip|Temporal Paradox}} by 1.
* {{SpellTooltip|Singularity Beam}} unavailable.
* Pet Ability Power increased, based on Pet level<br/><math>\text{PAP} = 1.17^\text{PetLevel}</math>
* Character Class is unchangeable.
* Active Pet is unchangeable.
* Foundation, Tools, Power [[Heritage|Heritages]] are available.

