===Stabilize The Flow Snap===
{| class="wikitable" style= "max-width:800px"
|-
! Goal
| 
Stack Incant & Max Time Distortion gear to cast Stabilise The Flow and then swap sets so it's still effected by incant gear until duration runs out.
|}

{{GuideBox
|spells=#4#StabilizeTheFlow@26,2;29,2;-1,0;4,0;69,0;68,2
|items=#4#StabilizeTheFlow@100;113;7;23;18;32;41;68;56;85;72;1022;209;301;411;409;91;2007;3001;509}}

{{Note|Swap to this set's items with the P+5 hotkeys from a set that casts {{SpellTooltip|Temporal Distortion}}(like Void Mana) to allow Time Distortion to grow to max (27), before fully swapping both spells and items with Q+5 and snapping {{SpellTooltip|Stabilize The Flow}}}}

* The Position of {{SpellTooltip|Stabilize The Flow}} is in slot 5, the same as the set's hotkey number, to make it simpler to activate when quickly switching from the Void Mana to Burst. With Chronomancer's time distortion, you lose VM rapidly, so making this easier to input helps lose less VM in the transition through your snap sets
* Enchants on {{ItemTooltip|Stabilizing Pauldrons}} and {{ItemTooltip|Timeshroud}} don't matter.

