* {{SpellTooltip|Gem Resonance}} will run out very quickly, so use your hotkeys to switch back and forth between your Burst and GR Snap sets (hotkeys 6 and 7) to refresh its duration. Repeat this a few times until your VM decays too much and you're no longer able to buy new sources or upgrades.
* {{SpellTooltip|Revert}} in the GR snap set will prevent you from needing to re-snap StF.
* At enchant 24+5 {{ItemTooltip|Falconer's Leather Wrappings}} beats {{ItemTooltip|Conjured Razorspaulders}}

