* Rough priority is PAP > Incant = CAP >> cEXP.  Leave Autoclick at 1.
* Autoclick is placed to reduce the cost growth of Nexi, as both {{ItemTooltip|Temporal Stabilizer}} and {{SpellTooltip|Converge Timelines}} scale with Nexi amount.
* With enough Spell Mastery, autoclick scaling gets +0.02 and is worth investing some small amount of ingots into.
* Evocation and summoning scale so poorly that the increased cost growth make them not worth placing compared to having more sources for the source scaling upgrades and exp, so it is advised not to enter your Spell Mastery amount into the sheet, as it will distort the results.

